== Dance troupe ==
The members of the dance troupe included Darren Bennett & Crystal Main, Ian Waite & Aneta Piotrowska, and Shem Jacobs & Tanya Perera.<ref>{{cite web |title=The Strictly Showdancers |url=http://www.bbc.co.uk/strictlycomedancing/2010/dancers/showdancers/ |accessdate=16 November 2010 |publisher=BBC}}</ref>

The dance troupe performed the following:
*Launch show: Quickstep and jive, "[[The Ballroom Blitz|Ballroom Blitz]]" — [[The Sweet|Sweet]]
*Week 2: Quickstep, "[[Hey, Soul Sister]]" — [[Train (band)|Train]]
*Week 5: Viennese waltz,  "[[Never Tear Us Apart]]" — [[INXS]]
*Week 6: Rock 'n' Roll,  "Rock 'n' Roll Is Here to Stay" — [[Danny and the Juniors]], "[[Roll Over Beethoven]]" — [[Chuck Berry]] & "[[Shake, Rattle And Roll]]" — [[Bill Haley (musician)|Bill Haley]]
*Week 7: Paso doble,  "[[The Entertainer (Alesha Dixon album)|Radio]]" — [[Alesha Dixon]]
*Week 10: [[ABBA]] medley ("[[Mamma Mia (ABBA song)|Mamma Mia]]", "[[Lay All Your Love on Me]]" & "[[Take a Chance on Me]]")
*Week 11: Paso doble,  "[[Fire With Fire (song)|Fire With Fire]]" — [[Scissor Sisters]]

